    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/e5/PollyanaQBULB.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240713023354\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"PollyanaQBULB\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/e5/PollyanaQBULB.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240713023354\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"735\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"PollyanaQBULB.jpg\" data-image-key=\"PollyanaQBULB.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>丰收公主</b>\n</p><p>一位出生在操控植物世家的丰收女祭司家族的女性。为了成为一位强大而慈爱的女祭司，她每天刻苦训练。虽然平时温顺，但过去激怒过她的人都被藤蔓捆缚悬挂了三天三夜。\n\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820185133\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39620-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820185133 and revision id 63590. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
